G28 X0 ;move X to min endstops, so the head is out of the way
G90 ;Absolute positioning
G1 Y200 F3000 ;Present print
M84 ;steppers off
M300 P300 S4000
M117 Finished.

M82 ;absolute extrusion mode
M104 S0
